  Uploading on a page never saved waits until its first save, in the same way.
  **You get:** the markdown names the `CONTENT` ID itself. **You give up:** a second way to keep an original and a re-encode, beside `PHOTO`'s. The upload request also re-encodes a phone photo while the person waits, which can pass 750ms for a large one.

